# Network: upload and download rates, meeting at a centre bar.
Output assets/network.gif

Source demo/tapes/themes/gruvbox.tape
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono"
Set FontSize 11
Set Width 968
Set Height 382
Set Padding 9
Set BorderRadius 5
Set Framerate 20
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Hide
Type "gc-prepare --theme gruvbox --layout horizontal --refresh 1 --history 120 --no-alerts"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "gc --net"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Hide
Sleep 122s
Show

Sleep 18s

Hide
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
